{"lines": ["How is Grug connected to Napoleon?", "Grug, the caveman dad of The Croods, is voiced by Nicolas Cage.", "In two thousand one, Cage sat beside Lisa Marie Presley at the Capitol, and the next year they married.", "Her father was Elvis Presley, pictured here with baby Lisa Marie in nineteen sixty-eight.", "In December nineteen seventy, Elvis showed up at the White House asking President Nixon for a narcotics badge.", "In nineteen sixty-nine, Nixon flew to Paris to meet French President Charles de Gaulle.", "De Gaulle's France traces its line of rulers back to Napoleon, through kings and emperors.", "How is Adolf Hitler connected to Neil Armstrong?", "In March nineteen forty-one, Hitler hosted Japan's foreign minister, Yosuke Matsuoka, in Berlin.", "Two weeks later, Matsuoka was in Moscow, signing a neutrality pact while Joseph Stalin looked on.", "In nineteen forty-nine, Mao Zedong came to Moscow for Stalin's seventieth birthday.", "In nineteen seventy-two, Richard Nixon became the first American president to visit Mao in China.", "And back in nineteen sixty-nine, Nixon greeted Neil Armstrong through a quarantine window, days after he walked on the Moon.", "How is Nikola Tesla connected to The Rock?", "In eighteen ninety-four, Mark Twain visited Tesla's New York lab and held a lamp lit by wireless power.", "Twain befriended a young Helen Keller, and they posed together at writer Laurence Hutton's home.", "In nineteen sixty-one, Keller visited the White House to meet President John F Kennedy.", "A year later, Kennedy and his wife Jackie hosted a White House dinner for France's culture minister.", "In nineteen eighty-five, Jackie joined Ronald and Nancy Reagan at a fundraiser for the Kennedy Library.", "Two years earlier, Nancy sat on Santa's lap at the White House, and Santa was Mister T.", "In nineteen eighty-five, Mister T teamed up with Hulk Hogan in the main event of the first WrestleMania.", "And at WrestleMania 30 in twenty fourteen, Hogan went face to face with The Rock.", "How is Neymar connected to Queen Elizabeth the Second?", "In July twenty nineteen, at the Copa Am\u00e9rica final in Rio, Neymar posed with Brazil's president Jair Bolsonaro.", "That October in Tokyo, Bolsonaro met Prince Charles; both had come for Japan's new emperor's enthronement ceremony.", "And in twenty twenty-two, Charles stood beside his mother, Queen Elizabeth the Second, for her Platinum Jubilee on the palace balcony.", "How is Franklin D Roosevelt connected to Lee Joongjay?", "In nineteen thirty-nine, Roosevelt took King George the Sixth sailing, on the first American visit by a reigning British king.", "During World War Two, the King met RAF bomber crews with his daughter, Princess Elizabeth.", "As Queen, in twenty twenty-one she hosted Emmanuel Macron and the other G7 leaders in Cornwall.", "And in twenty twenty-five, Macron posed with Squid Game star Lee Joongjay at a charity gala in Paris."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.24], ["is", 0.24, 0.4], ["Grug", 0.4, 0.88], ["connected", 0.88, 1.52], ["to", 1.52, 1.74], ["Napoleon?", 1.74, 1.98], ["Grug,", 3.16, 3.48], ["the", 3.64, 3.66], ["caveman", 3.66, 4.08], ["dad", 4.08, 4.26], ["of", 4.26, 4.56], ["the", 4.56, 4.7], ["Crudes,", 4.7, 5.08], ["is", 5.2, 5.3], ["voiced", 5.3, 5.48], ["by", 5.48, 5.74], ["Nicholas", 5.74, 5.96], ["Cage.", 5.96, 6.28], ["In", 6.74, 6.8], ["2001,", 6.8, 7.38], ["Cage", 7.5, 7.7], ["sat", 7.7, 7.94], ["beside", 7.94, 8.16], ["Lisa", 8.16, 8.46], ["Marie", 8.46, 8.72], ["Presley", 8.72, 9.18], ["at", 9.18, 9.34], ["the", 9.34, 9.44], ["Capitol,", 9.44, 9.72], ["and", 10.14, 10.34], ["the", 10.34, 10.46], ["next", 10.46, 10.68], ["year", 10.68, 10.96], ["they", 10.96, 11.14], ["married.", 11.14, 11.42], ["Her", 11.9, 12.0], ["father", 12.0, 12.26], ["was", 12.26, 12.54], ["Elvis", 12.54, 12.8], ["Presley,", 12.8, 13.38], ["pictured", 13.66, 13.8], ["here", 13.8, 14.08], ["with", 14.08, 14.26], ["baby", 14.26, 14.46], ["Lisa", 14.46, 14.96], ["Marie", 14.96, 